          "end": 768,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.25.110:block:1",
          "start": 384
        },
        "quote": "(b) Written requests for grants to be used for programs and projects aimed at the expeditious removal of graffiti shall be submitted to the City. By resolution, the Council shall establish the procedure to govern the grant application and review. The City Manager shall make the final determination on awards. (Ord. 18730 § 4, 10-17-06; Ord. 17538 §§ 2, 3, 9-5-00. Code 1995 § 2-332.)",
